# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Project-Specific Notes
# ------------------------------------------------------------

# IMPORTANT:
# data/processed/ is intentionally NOT ignored because the small
# processed CSV samples are part of the project's reproducible analysis.
#
# knime/ is intentionally NOT ignored because the KNIME workflow
# is part of the project methodology.
#
# output/ is intentionally NOT ignored because the saved LLM outputs
# document the V1/V2, V3, V4, and V4.1 experiments.
#
# prompts/ is intentionally NOT ignored because prompt engineering
# is part of the experimental methodology.
#
# docs/ is intentionally NOT ignored because it contains the
# methodology, experiment documentation, and findings.